   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Countries and nationality",
   "texto": [
    "**Nerelisin?** means «Where are you from?». It forms with **nereli** (from which place) and the termination of «You».",
    "**İspanya'danım** = I am from Spain (literally «I am from Spain»). The **-dan/-den** suffix indicates provenance and changes according to vocal harmony. After a country written with capital, it is put on an apostrophe: **İspanya'dan**.",
    "**İspanyolum** expresses «I'm Spanish.»; the personal suffix is attached to the word."
   ]
  },
